# FT0 Chat Widget - Environment Configuration
# 
# COST OPTIMIZATION: Haiku 4.5 (0.33x cost vs Sonnet)
# Pricing: $0.80/$2.40 per 1M tokens (vs $3/$15 for Sonnet)
# 

# PRIMARY: Manifest API with Haiku 4.5
# Get from: https://manifest.conversationmine.ai/api/keys
MANIFEST_API_KEY=mk-...

# FALLBACK: Claude API with Haiku 4.5
# Get from: https://console.anthropic.com/api_keys
CLAUDE_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# OPTIONAL: GitHub Personal Access Token
# Get from: https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
# Required for: Rate limiting, GitHub-specific features
# Scopes: Only needs "public_repo" or minimal access
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...

# Runtime
NODE_ENV=production

# Model Configuration
# DEFAULT: claude-3-5-haiku-20241022 (Haiku 4.5)
# - Cost efficient: 0.33x vs Sonnet
# - Fast: Sub-second responses
# - Quality: Sufficient for recruiter Q&A
